an><span>https://www.anthropic.com/claude-sonnet-4-5-system-card</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>[官方] Introducing Claude Opus 4.5（2025-11）：</span><span>https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-opus-4-5</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>[官方] Claude Haiku 4.5（2025-10）：</span><span>https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-haiku-4-5</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:30px 0;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:72px;height:2px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#059669,transparent);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;letter-spacing:0.4px;\"><em style=\"font-style:italic;\"><span>整理：2026-10-01 月绡凝 · 依据官方发布说明。</span></em></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 0;\"><section style=\"height:1px;background:#E5E7EB;margin-bottom:28px;\"><span><br /></span></section></section></section><p style=\"display: none;\"><mp-style-type></mp-style-type></p>", "archived_at": "2026-10-26T10:33:46+0800"}